# "Any number of target creatures" includes zero (CR 107.1c, 601.2d), so with no creature on the battlefield Pyrokinesis is
# still a legal cast, choosing no targets, and it resolves dealing no damage. (It used to be withheld because it needed at
# least one target, and the bots that tried it gave up and tried again for ever.)
#
# On turn 1 nothing is on the battlefield; Bot1 exiles Lightning Bolt to cast it. Pyrokinesis goes to the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Pyrokinesis
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x5
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Pyrokinesis.Cast(Ability: Exile)
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Bot1.Graveyard = Pyrokinesis
Exile = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Life = 20
